<https://example.org/corvane/claims> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Corvane Mutual claims modernisation schema" ;
    rdfs:comment "Hand-written knowledge-graph schema for the Corvane Mutual claims-platform modernisation (from the legacy CLARA platform to the Claims Hub microservices). It uses canonical terms only. Relationship labels are UPPER_SNAKE and their IRIs are camelCase; class labels are the canonical names; datatype property labels equal their IRI local names. Properties with more than one possible subject or object class use owl:unionOf." ;
